# Ruleset: Alibaba
#
# Expects a mainland policy.
#
# Commerce, payments, cloud, DingTalk, Amap and the device fingerprint hosts. alicdn.com lives in Direct/CDNChina.list; Youku in Media/Youku.list. UC Browser and Quark (ucweb.com, uc.cn, myquark.cn) reached the mainland path only through GEOIP and the .cn rule, 247 flows in the 14 days to 2026-11-02; Quark's download hosts stay in Direct/Download.list. The security hosts the reject layer would take first are repaired in Rescue/Alibaba.list, and the anycast space the apps dial by address is in Geo/AlibabaCIDR.list.

